WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.040
 There are times that you may want 
  to export your work from RStudio Cloud, 

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.240
 and we've done our best 
  to make it as easy as possible for you. 

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.120
 Navigating to our workspace 
  from within RStudio Cloud

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:15.840
 we see that there are a few projects  

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:19.600
 listed. To the right of each 
  project is an export button. 

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.920
 And by clicking on this, 
  RStudio Cloud initiates 

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.840
 the creation of a project file 
  that we can download. Once complete

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:29.960
 the popup shows us the download button.  

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.320
 Clicking the download 
  button downloads a zip file 

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.600
 with all of the associated project files 
  that we can now run in our local machine. 

